- Jangka panjang: DAO Treasury 408,5M UNI mendanai grants dan inisiatif; komunitas governance aktif meskipun quorum 40M UNI sulit dicapai (proposal fee switch dan buyback gagal)【Phase 3 — EV-010, EV-040】(HIGH)
- Dasar: Phase 6 Distribution; Phase 3 EV-010, EV-040 (HIGH)

POV Developer (Integrator & frontend builder): Sukses
